  "specVersion": 31,
  "derivedFrom": null,
  "title": "The v12 constructs demo",
  "description": [
    "A demonstration of everything specVersion 12 opened: an optional macro the run chooses (with a declared default), a macro placed against a section, a closing macro carrying the profile signature, conditional macros gated on a tone classifier, a template node whose render IS its output, and two checks — the note's passes, while the letter's fixed template text cannot cover the referral's clinical terms and records a deterministic failure. Not intended for clinical use."
  ],
